Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
NOTE (2026-11-10): the inputs of this notebook were corrected against ENSDF: \
Fr-223 alpha branch 6e-3 -> 6e-5 (0.006 %); At-219 branches b8a/b8b swapped \
back (alpha 0.936 to Bi-215, beta 0.064 to Rn-219); Po-215 beta branch 2.3e-4 \
-> 2.3e-6; decay constants of the two Po-215 daughters (n12/n13: Pb-211 and \
At-215) and of the two Bi-211 daughters (n15/n16: Tl-207 and Po-211) were \
assigned to the wrong nodes and are swapped, so At-215 is now n13 and Po-211 \
is n16. b11b 0.1 -> 1. (Output cells of this notebook were not changed.) The \
saved outputs, equations and plots below were produced with the OLD inputs \
and are stale until the notebook is re-evaluated. The original, uncorrected \
notebook is in villano-lab/L3He_paper2023, neutron-bknd-spectra/decay_chains/.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d1a20382-71a2-45cf-9cde-666261b8f2e1"],

